# Shop API requests for editors that run .http files (VS Code REST Client,
# JetBrains HTTP Client). Variables below are placeholders; put the access
# token in the editor's private environment file, which stays out of version
# control, and reference it as {{accessToken}}.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@apiPrefix = /api/v1

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Get one item
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/items/sku-1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Request-ID: manual-check-0001

### Missing item returns 404 problem details
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/items/does-not-exist
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Missing token returns 401 with WWW-Authenticate
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/items/sku-1

### Disallowed CORS origin gets no Access-Control-Allow-Origin header
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/items/sku-1
Origin: https://not-allowed.example.test
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
